eam Bird Hub</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/join-the-flock">Join the Flock</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/spc-507">SPC-507</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3570">EE-3570</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-sacred-djehuti">The Sacred Djehuti</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/avian-anthology-i">Avian Anthology I</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/avian-anthology-ii">Avian Anthology II</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4688">SCP-4688</a></td> <td>A unit of intelligent <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3095">SCP-3095</a>-affected seabirds. Eta-4 specializes in information collection and analysis, field research, complementary field support, and in extreme cases, airborne combat. The task force was ultimately charged with protecting humanity after the BE-Class &quot;Migration&quot; End-of-Consciousness Scenario.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/task-forces#eta-5">MTF-Eta-5</a></td> <td>Jäeger Bombers</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2764">SCP-2764</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/lte-2712-bosch">LTE-2712-Bosch</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/animalia">Animalia</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5514">SCP-5514</a></td> <td>A rapid-response unit specializing in the tracking, capturing, and containment of Large-Scale Aggressors (entities over 30m in height). Deploys from, and detains LSAs within Dimensional-Site-172.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Eta-6</td> <td>Awareness Filters</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1504">SCP-1504</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Eta-6</td> <td><span style="color: red">Presented</span> <span style="color: green">In</span> <span style="color: blue">Color</span></td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5020">SCP-5020</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5599">SCP-5599</a></td> <td>Investigation of <a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/arcadia-hub">GoI-078</a> (<span style="color: purple">Arcadia</span>) and