&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #43d738&quot;&gt;(E)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/photoshopping-your-scp&quot;&gt;Photoshopping Your SCP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: An essay/tutorial for easily creating illustrations for your articles with Photoshop.&lt;/li&gt;
