&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-979875-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Though we suspect Dr. Martens placed it here.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-979875-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Which may or may not be his real name.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
